      "id": "claim_c68dbb2514d94db7966b52073217dbf7",
      "statement": "In observability layering, observability-api.ts is the only place that talks HTTP, observability-parse.ts validates every response, observability-session.ts funnels every read through one #observe so no path returns data unaudited, and observability-discovery.ts derives field names/values from a sampled events query.",
