    {
      "id": "claim_0075c81dfc714f16a122efabb609a409",
      "statement": "Worker-scoped observability bindings prepend an immutable $metadata.service filter and re-filter the response, since telemetry/keys and /values ignore the filters they accept; a dropped event proves the filter was dropped, so the provider's own count is withheld (it would count the whole account) and the drop is logged at error.",
